#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:110
msgid "Reopen &projects at startup"
msgstr "Heropen projekte by opstart"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:118
msgid "R&eopen files at startup"
msgstr "Heropen lêers by opstart"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:122
msgid ""
"If this is enabled Kate will attempt to reopen files that were open when you "
"closed last time. Cursor position will be recovered if possible. Non-"
"existent files will not be opened."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie is geaktiveer Kate sal poog na heropen lêers wat was open wanneer "
"jy gesluit laaste tyd. Plekaanduier posisie sal wees herwin As moontlik. Non-"
"existent lêers sal nie wees geöpende."

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:130
msgid "Restore &window configuration"
msgstr "Herstel venster opstelling"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:133
msgid ""
"Check this if you want all your views and frames restored each time you open "
"Kate"
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie as jy wil hê alle jou aansigte en rame gerestoreer elke tyd "
"jy open Kate"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:137
msgid "&Appearance"
msgstr "Verskyning"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:142
msgid "&Show full path in title"
msgstr "Vertoon volgrote path soeklys in titel"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:144
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the full document path will be shown in the "
"window caption."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie is nagegaan, die volgrote dokument gids soeklys sal wees "
"vertoon in die venster kas-tipe."

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:149
msgid "&Behavior"
msgstr "Gedrag"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:154
msgid "Allow Kate to use more than one UN&IX process"
msgstr "Toelaat Kate na gebruik meer as een Unix proses"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:158
msgid ""
"If this is unchecked, Kate will only use one UNIX process. If you try "
"running it again, the current process will get the focus, and open any files "
"you requested to be opened. If it is checked, each time you start Kate, a "
"new UNIX process will be started."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie is onbevestig, Kate sal slegs gebruik een Unix proses. As jy "
"probeer wat loop dit weer, die huidige proses sal kry die fokus, en open "
"enige lêers jy versoekte na wees geöpende. As dit is nagegaan, elke tyd jy "
"begin Kate, 'n nuwe Unix proses sal wees beginne."

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:165
msgid "Sync &terminal emulator with active document"
msgstr "Sinkronisasie terminaal emulasie met aktief dokument"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:168
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the built in Konsole will <code>cd</code> to the "
"directory of the active document when started and whenever the active "
"document changes, if the document is a local file."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie is nagegaan, die gebou in Konsole sal <code>cd</code> na die gids "
"van die aktief dokument wanneer beginne en wanneer ook al die aktief "
"dokument verander, As die dokument is 'n plaaslike lêer."

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:175
msgid "Wa&rn about files modified by foreign processes"
msgstr "Waarskuwing omtrent lêers verander deur vreemde prosesse"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:178
msgid ""
"If enabled, when Kate receives focus you will be asked what to do with files "
"that have been modified on the hard disk. If not enabled, you will be asked "
"what to do with a file that has been modified on the hard disk only when "
"that file gains focus inside Kate."
msgstr ""
"As aktiveerd is, wanneer Kate ontvang fokus jy sal gevra word wat om met die "
"lêers te doen wat verander is op die harde skyf. As nie aktiveer, sal jy "
"gevra word wat om te doen met 'n lêer wat verander is op die harde skyf "
"slegs wanneer daardie lêer fokus in Kate wen."

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:186
msgid "Meta-Information"
msgstr "Meta-Inligting"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:191
msgid "Keep &meta-information past sessions"
msgstr "Hou meta-inligting verlede sessies"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:194
