"Check this if you want document configuration like for example bookmarks to "
"be saved past editor sessions. The configuration will be restored if the "
"document has not changed when reopened."
msgstr ""
"Kontroleur hierdie as jy wil dat dokument konfigurasie soos byvoorbeeld "
"boekmerke gestoor moet word na redigeer sessies. Die konfigurasie sal "
"herstoor word as die dokument nie verander is nie wanneer heropen."

